Dict.Help.Text=The old Zen wisdom says:\n\n    Developer had a problem.\n    Developer decided to solve the problem with regular expressions.\n    Developer had two problems.\n\nRegEx, or regular expressions, are something you would rather not deal with, but it is fancy to have that option, so here it is.\n\nIf you know what you are doing, knock yourself out. If not, just don't use it, or ask Google.
